<title>UK: Muenchener Hypo sets 100 million mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Muenchener Hypo sets 100 million mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MUENCHENER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    25.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.31     PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    MUNICH</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 527</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
